# Code owners for et-dagen.
#
# The `prod` branch ruleset requires code owner review, so a pull request into
# `prod` needs an approval from a member of @et-dagen/managers. Releases no
# longer use such pull requests: the "Promote to production" workflow moves
# `prod` after a manager approves the `production-promotion` environment. This
# file still covers the rare pull request from `prod` back into `dev`, and any
# pull request someone opens against `prod` by mistake.
#
# Ordinary feature pull requests into `dev` are unaffected by this file: `dev`
# requires one approval from any member with write access, and code owner
# review is only enforced by the `prod` ruleset.

* @et-dagen/managers
